%N A400936 Product of the distinct entries in the central row and column of the (2*n + 1) X (2*n + 1) square spiral.
%H A400936 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulam_spiral">Ulam spiral</a>.
%F A400936 a(n) = Product_{k = 1..n}(((4*k^2 + 1)^2 - k^2)*((4*k^2 + 1)^2 - 9*k^2)).
%e A400936 For n = 1, the array is:
%e A400936   5 4 3
%e A400936   6 1 2
%e A400936   7 8 9,
%e A400936 and a(1) = 2*4*1*6*8 = 384.
